OL,3,GNEWSAMan attempted to murder sleeping
OL,4,Ahomeless man with baseball bat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who attempted to murder a
OL,7,Fhomeless man in an unprovoked attack
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for more than nine
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FCampbell Brett struck Gordon Skillen
OL,12,Fwith a baseball bat as he slept with a
OL,13,Fgroup of other men outside a Tesco
OL,14,Fstore in Tomnahurich Street, Inverness,
OL,15,Fin July.
OL,17,FJailing Brett at the High Court in
OL,18,FEdinburgh, the judge said the
OL,19,F24-year-old had been "utterly reckless"
OL,20,Fand there was no provocation for the
OL,21,Fattack.
